### Demo PRISMA - Nominations API (REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP)
### Levantar la API en http://localhost:8081 con SECURITY_ENABLED (token dev-token).

@api = http://localhost:8081
@token = dev-token
@nominationId = PEGAR_AQUI_EL_NOMINATION_ID

### E1 - Solicitud valida (202). Procesa el mock de ABM y aprueba.
POST {{api}}/v1/nominations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-clave-1
X-Correlation-Id: corr-demo-1

{
  "customer_id": "123456",
  "account_id": "987654",
  "card_id": "TOKEN_OR_MASKED_REFERENCE",
  "alias": "CUENTA_PRINCIPAL",
  "request_id": "8fcb3fa0-7f19-4fc2-a803-cc76ac815001"
}

### E2 - Datos obligatorios ausentes (400)
POST {{api}}/v1/nominations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "account_id": "987654",
  "alias": "CUENTA_PRINCIPAL",
  "request_id": "8fcb3fa0-7f19-4fc2-a803-cc76ac815002"
}

### E3 - Solicitud repetida (idempotente: misma respuesta)
POST {{api}}/v1/nominations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-clave-1

{
  "customer_id": "123456",
  "account_id": "987654",
  "card_id": "TOKEN_OR_MASKED_REFERENCE",
  "alias": "CUENTA_PRINCIPAL",
  "request_id": "8fcb3fa0-7f19-4fc2-a803-cc76ac815001"
}

### E5 - Rechazo funcional de ABM (sufijo _REJ)
POST {{api}}/v1/nominations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-rej-1

{
  "customer_id": "123456",
  "account_id": "987654_REJ",
  "card_id": "TOKEN_REFERENCE",
  "alias": "CUENTA_REJ",
  "request_id": "8fcb3fa0-7f19-4fc2-a803-cc76ac815003"
}

### Consultar estado
GET {{api}}/v1/nominations/{{nominationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Consultar historial
GET {{api}}/v1/nominations/{{nominationId}}/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
